title: A guest leaves the session and joins again with the same invitation: it gets the text as it is now and can write
folders: share-text
limit: 75
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
expect-log: saved .*notes\.txt
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: (?s)^while-away\.line 01\nline 02\n.*\nline 12back\.\n$
guest-expect-log: opening .*shared.*share-text

wait 3000
share join nothing Ana
share start writers
wait 10500
edit notes.txt 1 1
type while-away.
wait 9000
share panel
wait 1200
mark host-after-rejoin
wait 6000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4500
share stop
wait 1500
mark after-leaving
wait 3500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4000
goto notes.txt
wait 1500
mark joined-again
wait 600
edit notes.txt 12 1
key end
type back.
wait 500
key save
wait 3000
quit
wait 1500
